<section class="phero"><img class="phero-bg" src="/assets/img/photos/newport-harbor.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/newport-harbor-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/newport-harbor.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="675" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/rhode-island-communities/">Communities</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>Newport</nav><p class="tag">Aquidneck Island</p><h1>Insurance Appraiser in Newport, Rhode Island</h1><p class="lede">Colonial houses on the Point, Gilded Age mansions on Bellevue Avenue and a coastline open to the Atlantic make Newport claims highly specialized.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn glass" href="/request-a-claim-review/">Free claim review</a></div><dl class="facts"><div><dt>County</dt><dd>Newport County</dd></div><div><dt>Region</dt><dd>Aquidneck Island</dd></div><div><dt>Inspections</dt><dd>On site</dd></div></dl></div></section><div class="wrap layout"><article class="prose"><div class="note"><p class="note-t">Local claim risks</p><ul class="chips"><li>Hurricane wind</li><li>Salt spray &amp; wind-driven rain</li><li>Storm surge (flood policy)</li><li>Historic materials</li><li>Ice dams</li></ul></div>
<p>Insurance appraisal in Newport often hinges on materials and methods. Historic district rules can affect which windows, siding, roofing and trim a repair can use. Old-growth wood, hand-split shingles, slate, copper flashing and period millwork cost far more than modern stand-ins, and estimates that assume otherwise come up short.</p>
<h2>Exposure on Aquidneck Island</h2>
<p>Ocean Drive and the southern shore face the open Atlantic. Wind-driven rain and salt spray work into siding and windows during nor’easters and tropical storms, and surge affects low-lying waterfront areas. We separate wind and rain damage from flood damage so each policy is presented with the right scope.</p>
<h2>Large and high-value homes</h2>
<p>Estate homes may carry high-value policies with guaranteed or extended replacement cost. Valuing them takes detailed scopes, specialty trades and sometimes architects or conservators.</p><h2>Neighborhoods and villages we cover in Newport</h2><ul class="chips plain"><li>The Point</li><li>Historic Hill</li><li>Fifth Ward</li><li>Bellevue Avenue</li><li>Ocean Drive</li><li>Broadway</li><li>Kay-Catherine</li><li>Easton’s Point</li></ul><h2>Housing in Newport</h2><p>Newport has one of the largest concentrations of colonial-era buildings in the country, much of it in the Point and Historic Hill. Bellevue Avenue and Ocean Drive have large estates and shingle-style houses, and neighborhoods like the Fifth Ward and Broadway have dense wood-frame homes.</p><h2>Newport storm history</h2><ul class="mini-timeline"><li><b>1938</b><span>The New England Hurricane caused major damage along the Newport shore.</span></li><li><b>1954</b><span>Hurricane Carol flooded the waterfront.</span></li><li><b>1991</b><span>Hurricane Bob damaged boats, docks and coastal property.</span></li><li><b>2012</b><span>Superstorm Sandy damaged the Cliff Walk and shoreline areas.</span></li></ul><h2>Services available in Newport</h2><p>Every Rhode Island Insurance Appraiser service is available to owners in Newport and nearby towns, including:</p><ul><li><a href="/claim-valuation-services/appraisal-clause-advocacy/">Appraisal Clause Representation</a></li><li><a href="/claim-valuation-services/homeowner-claim-valuation/">Homeowner Claim Valuation</a></li><li><a href="/claim-valuation-services/commercial-condo-hoa-claims/">Commercial, Condo &amp; HOA Claims</a></li><li><a href="/claim-valuation-services/roof-hail-claim-valuation/">Roof &amp; Hail Damage</a></li><li><a href="/claim-valuation-services/wind-microburst-tornado-claims/">Wind, Microburst &amp; Tornado Damage</a></li><li><a href="/claim-valuation-services/hurricane-tropical-storm-claims/">Hurricane &amp; Tropical Storm Claims</a></li><li><a href="/claim-valuation-services/water-leak-sewer-backup-claims/">Water Damage &amp; Leak Claims</a></li></ul><h2>Questions from Newport owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Do historic district rules affect what my claim should pay?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>If the city requires specific materials or methods, the cost of meeting that requirement may be part of the repair. Ordinance-or-law coverage can also matter.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you work on high-value estate homes?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. These claims often need specialty trades and detailed documentation.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you cover Middletown, Portsmouth and Jamestown too?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. We work throughout Newport County.</p></div></details></div><h2>Nearby communities</h2><div class="related"><a href="/rhode-island-communities/bristol/"><small>Nearby</small><span>Bristol</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/rhode-island-communities/narragansett/"><small>Nearby</small><span>Narragansett</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox